{"product_id":"smok-v12-price-replacement-coils-all-resistance","title":"SMOK V12 Price\/RBA Replacement Coils ( All Resistance )","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Smok TFV12 Prince Replacement Coils are unrivaled performance atomizer cores introduced with the amazing TFV12 Cloud Beast Prince Tank. Designed for mid-wattage configurations, it offers phenomenal flavor recreation and excellent vapor production. The TFV12 Prince introduces a variety of exotic configurations, such as V12 Prince Max Mesh, V12 Prince Dual Mesh, V12 Prince Triple Mesh, and Prince X2 Clapton.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCoil packs comes in a pack of (3) three replacement coils\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt is offered in a variety of different sub-ohm coils: V12 Prince-T10, V12 Prince-X6, V12 Prince-Q4, and V12 Prince-M4. The V12 Prince-T10 is the flagship atomizer technology, featuring a 0.12ohm within a Decuple coil cylinder to provide unsurpassed amount of vapor capability, with a wattage range of 60 to 120W.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor building enthusiasts, SMOKTech introduces a dynamic V12 Prince-RBA with pre-installed clapton coils. It features a two-post, dual terminal build deck for user-friendly configurations that accommodates a wide range of coil structures for users to match the sophisticated power of the Smok TFV12 Prince tank.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSMOK TFV12 Prince Replacement Coils Features:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePerformance Enhanced Coil Structure\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eV12-T10 Decuple coil Design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.12 ohm rated for 60-120W, recommended 80-110W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eV12-T6 Sextuple Coil Design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.17ohm rated for 90-320W, recommended 120-180W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eV12 RBA Rebuildable Head\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTwo-Post, Dual Terminal Design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDual Coil Configurations\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eV12 Prince Dual Mesh Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.2ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRated for 70-120W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRecommended 85-105W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"V12 Prince Mesh","offer_id":41775207055415,"sku":"S V12 Price\/RBA Replace Coils V12 Prince Mesh","price":1940.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"V12 Prince - X6","offer_id":41775207088183,"sku":"S V12 Price\/RBA Replace Coils V12 Prince - X6","price":1940.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"V12 Prince - T10","offer_id":41775207120951,"sku":"S V12 Price\/RBA Replace Coils V12 Prince - T10","price":1940.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"V12 Prince Max Mesh","offer_id":41775207153719,"sku":"S V12 Price\/RBA Replace Coils V12 Prince Max Mesh","price":1940.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"V12 RBA","offer_id":41775207186487,"sku":"S V12 Price\/RBA Replace Coils V12 RBA","price":1940.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"V12 RBA-T","offer_id":41775207219255,"sku":"S V12 Price\/RBA Replace Coils V12 RBA-T","price":1940.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"V12 - X4","offer_id":41775207252023,"sku":"S V12 Price\/RBA Replace Coils V12 - X4","price":1940.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"V12 - Q4","offer_id":41775207284791,"sku":"S V12 Price\/RBA Replace Coils V12 Q4","price":1940.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"V12 - T6","offer_id":41775207317559,"sku":"S V12 Price\/RBA Replace Coils V12 T6","price":1940.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/SMOK-V12-Prince-MESH-Coils.jpg?v=1752511677","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-v12-price-rep